# High Tier (Sales) — Google Sheets Workbook Template

**Who this is for:** Sales 500 / Sales 1000 / Sales 1500 clients  
**Total tabs:** 36  
**Builds on:** All 21 Medium Tier tabs, plus 15 additions below  
**Permission model:** Strictly enforced — see full permission table at bottom

---

## HOW TO SET UP

1. Make a copy of the **High Tier Master Template** spreadsheet.
2. Rename: `[Business Name] — Voice Agent (Sales)`
3. Share with Google Service Account email: **Editor** access.
4. Paste Sheet ID into Master Backend Sheet → Client Roster.
5. Set `outbound_enabled = TRUE`, `outbound_mode = manual` in Master Backend Sheet.
6. Fill in Business / Campaign Inputs tab with at least one campaign opener.
7. Install the Apps Script (see APPS_SCRIPT_SUBMIT_LEAD.js).
8. Test with one manual outbound lead before going live at scale.

