## TAB 22: Submit Outbound Lead

**Client-editable form.** Client fills this out to queue a single outbound lead.  
The green "Submit Lead" button triggers the Apps Script to validate and write to Outbound Queue.

### Cell Layout

| Cell | Label | Field | Required |
|------|-------|-------|----------|
| A3 | Lead Name | B3 | ✅ |
| A4 | Phone Number | B4 | ✅ |
| A5 | Email Address | B5 | |
| A6 | Campaign Type | B6 | ✅ (dropdown) |
| A7 | Service Interest | B7 | |
| A8 | Desired Outcome | B8 | ✅ |
| A9 | Relationship Type | B9 | ✅ (dropdown) |
| A10 | Consent Status | B10 | ✅ (dropdown) |
| A11 | Consent Source | B11 | |
| A12 | Last Interaction Date | B12 | |
| A13 | Preferred Call Window | B13 | (e.g., "Mornings", "After 5pm") |
| A14 | Notes | B14 | |
| A15 | Client Attestation ✅ | B15 | ✅ (checkbox — must be TRUE) |

### Dropdown Values

**Campaign Type (B6):**
- missed_call_recovery
- inbound_lead_followup
- quote_followup
- calendly_not_booked
- appointment_confirmation
- no_show_recovery
- review_request
- existing_customer_reactivation

**Relationship Type (B9):**
- Missed Caller
- Inbound Lead
- Website Form Lead
- Text/Email Responded
- Quote Request
- Existing Customer
- Past Customer
- No-Show
- Appointment Holder
- Review Request
- Referral With Permission
- Manual Review Approved

**Consent Status (B10):**
- Approved
- Prior Inquiry
- Existing Customer
- Appointment Related
- Quote Requested
- Manual Review Approved

### Client Attestation Text (display in cell A15 or near checkbox):
> "I certify that I have a legitimate, lawful basis to contact this individual.  
> This is NOT a cold lead, scraped contact, or purchased list.  
> I understand that misuse of this feature may result in account termination."

### Submit Button
- Label: "📞 Submit Lead"
- Action: Runs `submitOutboundLead()` Apps Script function
- Location: Somewhere visible near the form (B17 or nearby)

