## TAB 24: Outbound Queue 🔒

All queued outbound leads. Backend writes; client adds via Submit Outbound Lead form only.

| Col | Field |
|-----|-------|
| A | lead_id |
| B | lead_name |
| C | phone_number |
| D | email |
| E | source |
| F | campaign_type |
| G | service_interest |
| H | call_reason |
| I | desired_outcome |
| J | relationship_type |
| K | consent_status |
| L | consent_source |
| M | last_interaction_date |
| N | preferred_call_window |
| O | call_window_start |
| P | call_window_end |
| Q | attempt_count |
| R | max_attempts |
| S | status (Ready / In Progress / Completed / Blocked / Opted Out / Booked / Error) |
| T | priority (Normal / High / Urgent) |
| U | opt_out (TRUE/FALSE) |
| V | client_attestation (TRUE/FALSE) |
| W | validation_status |
| X | validation_notes |
| Y | notes |
| Z | lead_submitted_at |
| AA | last_updated |

**Status values:**
- **Pending Validation** → Just submitted, not yet checked
- **Ready** → Passed all 15 eligibility checks, ready to call
- **Blocked** → Failed one or more checks (see validation_notes)
- **In Progress** → Call currently active
- **Completed** → Call finished — see Outbound Results for outcome
- **Booked** → Appointment confirmed
- **Opted Out** → Person asked to be removed — auto-added to DNC
- **Error** → Technical failure during call placement

