## TAB 32: AI Improvement Suggestions

AI-generated script and FAQ improvements. Must be approved before taking effect.

| Col | Field |
|-----|-------|
| A | suggestion_id |
| B | call_id |
| C | business_id |
| D | suggestion_type (script / faq / objection / opener / phrase) |
| E | suggestion_text |
| F | reasoning |
| G | approved (FALSE by default — YOU set to TRUE to activate) |
| H | created_at |

**Workflow:**
1. AI generates suggestion → `approved = FALSE`
2. You review the suggestion in this tab
3. If good: change `approved = TRUE` → AI uses it on next call
4. If bad: leave as FALSE or delete the row

