## GOING LIVE CHECKLIST — HIGH TIER

- [ ] All Medium Tier checklist items completed
- [ ] Business / Campaign Inputs tab — at least one campaign fully filled in
- [ ] Apps Script installed and tested (Submit button works)
- [ ] Submit Outbound Lead form dropdowns configured
- [ ] `outbound_enabled = TRUE` in Master Backend Sheet
- [ ] `outbound_mode = manual` (start here — don't start with scheduled)
- [ ] Submit one test lead manually and verify it appears in Outbound Queue
- [ ] Trigger POST /api/outbound/worker?manual=true and verify call is placed
- [ ] Confirm Outbound Results and Campaign Analytics tabs populate
- [ ] Do Not Call tab tested with a known opt-out
- [ ] Best Time To Call tab begins populating
- [ ] After 10+ successful manual calls: optionally switch to `outbound_mode = scheduled_every_30_minutes`
